"<div class=\"brand-bar\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"brand-logo\"><div class=\"brand-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div></div>\n<header class=\"lk-hd\"><div class=\"lk-topic\"><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 20l1-4.2L16.2 4.6a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 2.3 0l.9.9a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 0 2.3L8.2 19z\"/><path d=\"M14.5 6.4l3.1 3.1\"/></svg></div><div class=\"lk-kicker\">Übung</div><div class=\"lk-big\">13</div><h1>과거형</h1><div class=\"lk-de\">Das Präteritum</div><div class=\"lk-intro\">Lektion 13의 문법을 직접 풀어 보며 익혀요.<br>A2 수준의 문장으로, 기본 16 · 중간 8 · 도전 6 · 보강 6 문제를 풀어요.<div class=\"x-goals\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">이 연습에서 확인할 것</div><div class=\"x-goal\">말할 때와 글에서 현재완료와 과거형을 구별해요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">규칙·불규칙·혼합 동사의 과거형을 만들어요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">sein·haben·werden과 화법조동사의 과거형을 써요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">화법조동사의 현재완료와 분리동사의 과거형 어순을 지켜요</div></div><div class=\"x-goals\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">풀이 방법</div><div class=\"x-goal\">보기를 고르거나, 빈칸에 쓰거나, 단어를 눌러 문장을 만들어요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">빈칸 옆 괄호와 한국어 뜻이 힌트예요. 대문자와 소문자는 구별하지 않아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">단어 배열에는 문장부호가 없어요. 문법에 맞는 어순이면 모두 정답이에요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">바꿔 쓰기는 문장 전체를 써요. 쉼표와 마침표는 채점하지 않아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">틀린 곳 찾기는 문장에서 틀린 단어 하나를 눌러요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">푼 답은 이 기기에 저장돼요. 새로고침하거나 앱을 업데이트해도 남아 있어요</div></div></div></header>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge review-badge\">기본</span><span class=\"sub-title\">기본 문제 · 배운 내용을 그대로 확인해요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"dc99437ea6\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;wohnte&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> Früher <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(wohnen)</span> ich in Daegu.</div><div class=\"qko\">예전에 나는 대구에 살았어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Früher <b>wohnte</b> ich in Daegu.</div>규칙 동사는 어간 + te예요. ich에는 어미를 더 붙이지 않아요 — ich wohnte.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"32ab578587\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;war&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Die Party <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(sein)</span> sehr lustig.</div><div class=\"qko\">파티는 아주 재미있었어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Die Party <b>war</b> sehr lustig.</div>sein의 과거형은 war예요. 말할 때도 과거형을 써요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"d658c6a104\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;hatten&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> Wir <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(haben)</span> gestern keine Lust.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리는 어제 하고 싶은 마음이 없었어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Wir <b>hatten</b> gestern keine Lust.</div>haben → hatte, wir에는 -n을 붙여요 — wir hatten.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"1b16239878\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> <span class=\"qblank\"></span> du gestern Abend zu Hause?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">a) Warst</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">b) Wurdest</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">c) War</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">d) Wart</button></div><div class=\"qe\">sein의 과거형 war에 du의 어미 -st를 붙여요 — du warst.<br>wart는 ihr의 형태예요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"de5c343046\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;musste&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> Meine Kollegin <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(müssen)</span> gestern bis zehn Uhr arbeiten.</div><div class=\"qko\">내 동료는 어제 10시까지 일해야 했어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Meine Kollegin <b>musste</b> gestern bis zehn Uhr arbeiten.</div>화법조동사의 과거형은 움라우트가 빠져요 — müssen → musste.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"4d7da4c40c\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;wart&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">6.</strong> Wo <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(sein)</span> ihr am Wochenende?</div><div class=\"qko\">너희 주말에 어디에 있었어요?</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Wo <b>wart</b> ihr am Wochenende?</div>sein의 과거형에서 ihr는 wart예요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"f3880474af\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;begann&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">7.</strong> Der Film <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(beginnen)</span> um neun Uhr.</div><div class=\"qko\">영화는 9시에 시작했어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Der Film <b>begann</b> um neun Uhr.</div>beginnen은 불규칙 동사예요. i → a — begann.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"1c5ccb366f\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;erzählte&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">8.</strong> Sie <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(erzählen)</span> ihrem Sohn eine Geschichte.</div><div class=\"qko\">그녀는 아들에게 이야기를 들려주었어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Sie <b>erzählte</b> ihrem Sohn eine Geschichte.</div>erzählen은 규칙 동사라서 어간 + te예요. er- 비분리 접두어는 그대로 붙어 있어요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"7935f9583d\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;wusste&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">9.</strong> Seine Telefonnummer <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(wissen)</span> ich nicht.</div><div class=\"qko\">나는 그의 전화번호를 몰랐어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Seine Telefonnummer <b>wusste</b> ich nicht.</div>wissen은 혼합 동사예요. 모음이 바뀌고 -te가 붙어요 — wusste.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"59fdcd4259\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">10.</strong> Der Kellner <span class=\"qblank\"></span> uns zwei Gläser Wasser. (bringen)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">a) bringte</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">b) brachtete</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">c) brachte</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">d) brang</button></div><div class=\"qe\">bringen은 혼합 동사예요 — brachte.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"d17517fa6d\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">11.</strong> 동사의 세 형태(원형 – 과거형 – 과거분사)가 모두 맞는 줄은?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">a) trinken – trank – getrunken</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">b) trinken – trunk – getrunken</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">c) trinken – trank – getrinken</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">d) trinken – trinkte – getrinkt</button></div><div class=\"qe\">trinken은 i – a – u로 바뀌는 불규칙 동사예요 — trinken – trank – getrunken.<br>-te와 -t를 붙인 줄은 규칙 동사의 모양이에요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"e5beebda0c\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">12.</strong> Ich <span class=\"qblank\"></span> gestern ein Taxi. (nehmen)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">a) nimm</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">b) nahm</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">c) nahmte</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">d) nehmte</button></div><div class=\"qe\">nehmen은 e → a로 바뀌는 불규칙 동사예요 — nahm. ich에는 어미가 없어요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"34778f1267\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">13.</strong> Gestern <span class=\"qblank\"></span> das Wetter plötzlich schlecht. (werden)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">a) würde</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">b) wird</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">c) wurdet</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">d) wurde</button></div><div class=\"qe\">werden의 과거형은 wurde예요. Gestern이 있으니 현재형 wird는 맞지 않아요.<br>würde는 움라우트가 붙은 다른 형태(30과)예요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"4e10b69c6c\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">14.</strong> Du <span class=\"qblank\"></span> gestern sehr spät nach Hause. (kommen)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">a) kommtest</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">b) kamst</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">c) kommst</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">d) kam</button></div><div class=\"qe\">kommen → kam. du에는 -st를 붙여요 — du kamst.<br>kommst는 현재형이라서 gestern과 맞지 않아요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"c1003de141\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Meine Oma las jeden Morgen die Zeitung&quot;,&quot;Jeden Morgen las meine Oma die Zeitung&quot;,&quot;Die Zeitung las meine Oma jeden Morgen&quot;,&quot;Meine Oma las die Zeitung jeden Morgen&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">15.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리 할머니는 매일 아침 신문을 읽으셨어요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">die</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Morgen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">las</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">jeden</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Zeitung</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">Meine</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">Oma</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Meine Oma las jeden Morgen die Zeitung.</b></div>과거형은 동사 하나라서 그대로 두 번째 자리에 와요.<br>lesen → las.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"50b1a466e2\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Der Film war wirklich langweilig&quot;,&quot;Wirklich langweilig war der Film&quot;,&quot;Langweilig war der Film wirklich&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">16.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 영화는 정말 지루했어요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Der</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">langweilig</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">war</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">wirklich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Film</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Der Film war wirklich langweilig.</b></div>sein → war, 두 번째 자리에 와요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">중간</span><span class=\"sub-title\">중간 문제 · 조건이 한두 개 더 붙어요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"2a1f6c5bf2\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">17.</strong> '일요일에 오래 잤어요.' — 친구에게 말할 때와 일기에 쓸 때 주로 쓰는 문장의 짝은?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">a) 말: Am Sonntag bin ich lange geschlafen. · 일기: Am Sonntag schlief ich lange.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">b) 말: Am Sonntag schlief ich lange. · 일기: Am Sonntag habe ich lange geschlafen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">c) 말: Am Sonntag habe ich lange geschlafen. · 일기: Am Sonntag schlief ich lange.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">d) 말: Am Sonntag habe ich lange geschlafen. · 일기: Am Sonntag schlafte ich lange.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">말할 때는 보통 현재완료, 일기·이야기 같은 글에서는 과거형을 써요.<br>schlafen → schlief(불규칙), 현재완료는 haben + geschlafen이에요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"0db23eb05a\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">18.</strong> '나는 어제 밤 12시까지 공부해야 했어요.'</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">a) Ich musste gestern bis Mitternacht lernen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">b) Ich habe gestern bis Mitternacht lernen gemusst.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">c) Ich musste gestern bis Mitternacht gelernt.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">d) Ich müsste gestern bis Mitternacht lernen.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">화법조동사의 과거형 musste가 두 번째 자리, 원형 lernen이 끝이에요.<br>müsste는 움라우트가 붙은 다른 형태예요. 현재완료라면 habe … lernen müssen이에요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"271b9de1ff\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;fuhr&quot;],[&quot;ab&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">19.</strong> Der Zug <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(abfahren)</span> um sechs Uhr <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\">.</div><div class=\"qko\">기차는 6시에 출발했어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Der Zug <b>fuhr</b> um sechs Uhr <b>ab</b>.</div>분리동사는 과거형에서도 접두어가 문장 끝으로 가요.<br>fahren → fuhr.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"8c49baf76a\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;stand&quot;],[&quot;auf&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">20.</strong> Früher <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(aufstehen)</span> mein Vater jeden Tag um fünf Uhr <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\">.</div><div class=\"qko\">예전에 아버지는 매일 5시에 일어나셨어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Früher <b>stand</b> mein Vater jeden Tag um fünf Uhr <b>auf</b>.</div>stehen → stand. 접두어 auf는 문장 끝이에요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"c73b4acbeb\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;kannte&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">21.</strong> Am Anfang <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(kennen)</span> ich nur zwei Leute in Berlin.</div><div class=\"qko\">처음에 나는 베를린에서 두 사람밖에 몰랐어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Am Anfang <b>kannte</b> ich nur zwei Leute in Berlin.</div>kennen은 혼합 동사예요 — kannte.<br>사람을 아는 것은 kennen, 사실을 아는 것은 wissen이에요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"68293e1f74\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;durften&quot;],[&quot;mussten&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">22.</strong> Früher <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(dürfen)</span> wir abends nicht fernsehen. Wir <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(müssen)</span> um acht Uhr schlafen gehen.</div><div class=\"qko\">예전에 우리는 저녁에 TV를 보면 안 됐어요. 8시에 자러 가야 했어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Früher <b>durften</b> wir abends nicht fernsehen. Wir <b>mussten</b> um acht Uhr schlafen gehen.</div>화법조동사 과거형은 움라우트가 빠져요 — durften · mussten.<br>원형 fernsehen·schlafen gehen은 끝에 와요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"5c60b8b269\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Ich wollte dich gestern anrufen&quot;,&quot;Gestern wollte ich dich anrufen&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">23.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">나는 어제 너에게 전화하고 싶었어요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">wollte</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">anrufen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Ich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">dich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">gestern</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Ich wollte dich gestern anrufen.</b></div>möchten은 과거형이 없어서 wollte로 말해요.<br>원형 anrufen은 붙어서 끝에 와요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"894ba7ef2a\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Wir haben gestern lange warten müssen&quot;,&quot;Gestern haben wir lange warten müssen&quot;,&quot;Lange haben wir gestern warten müssen&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">24.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리는 어제 오래 기다려야 했어요. (현재완료로)</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">gestern</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Wir</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">müssen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">warten</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">lange</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">haben</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Wir haben gestern lange warten müssen.</b></div>화법조동사의 현재완료는 끝에 원형이 두 개 와요 — warten müssen.<br>본동사 원형이 먼저, 화법조동사 원형이 맨 끝이에요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">도전</span><span class=\"sub-title\">도전 문제 · 함정과 예외까지 따져 봐요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"a1ef929abb\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;flog&quot;],[&quot;lief&quot;],[&quot;machte&quot;],[&quot;war&quot;],[&quot;schlief&quot;],[&quot;ein&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">25.</strong> Letzten Sommer <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(fliegen)</span> Mina nach Salzburg. Jeden Tag <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(laufen)</span> sie viele Kilometer und <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"><span class=\"qh\">(machen)</span> viele Fotos. Abends <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 4\"><span class=\"qh\">(sein)</span> sie sehr müde und <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 5\"><span class=\"qh\">(einschlafen)</span> früh <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 6\">.</div><div class=\"qko\">지난여름에 미나는 잘츠부르크로 날아갔어요. 매일 여러 킬로미터를 걸었고 사진을 많이 찍었어요. 저녁에는 아주 피곤해서 일찍 잠들었어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Letzten Sommer <b>flog</b> Mina nach Salzburg. Jeden Tag <b>lief</b> sie viele Kilometer und <b>machte</b> viele Fotos. Abends <b>war</b> sie sehr müde und <b>schlief</b> früh <b>ein</b>.</div>fliegen → flog, laufen → lief, machen → machte(규칙), sein → war.<br>einschlafen → schlief … ein, 접두어는 문장 끝이에요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"2c121c1452\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">26.</strong> 틀린 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">a) Er sah den Fehler sofort.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">b) Sie rufte mich gestern an.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">c) Wir mochten unseren Lehrer sehr.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">d) Ihr hattet Glück.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">rufen은 불규칙 동사라서 rief예요 — Sie rief mich gestern an.<br>mögen → mochte, sehen → sah, haben → ihr hattet은 모두 맞아요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"2ddc112703\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;wusste&quot;],[&quot;rief&quot;],[&quot;an&quot;],[&quot;nannte&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">27.</strong> Paul <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(wissen)</span> die Adresse nicht. Er <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(anrufen)</span> seine Schwester <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"> und sie <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 4\"><span class=\"qh\">(nennen)</span> ihm die Straße und die Hausnummer.</div><div class=\"qko\">파울은 주소를 몰랐어요. 그는 누나에게 전화했고, 누나가 그에게 거리 이름과 번지를 알려 주었어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Paul <b>wusste</b> die Adresse nicht. Er <b>rief</b> seine Schwester <b>an</b> und sie <b>nannte</b> ihm die Straße und die Hausnummer.</div>wissen → wusste, nennen → nannte는 혼합 동사예요.<br>anrufen은 불규칙 rief에 an이 문장 끝으로 가요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"d8b9f64b4b\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">28.</strong> '나는 어제 집에 있고 싶었어요.'</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">a) Ich möchte gestern zu Hause bleiben.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">b) Ich möchtete gestern zu Hause bleiben.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">c) Ich wollte gestern zu Hause bleiben.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">d) Ich mochte gestern zu Hause bleiben.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">möchten은 과거형이 따로 없어서 wollte로 말해요.<br>mochte는 mögen(좋아하다)의 과거형이라서 뜻이 달라요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"751937e51c\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;fuhren&quot;],[&quot;trafen&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">29.</strong> 현재완료를 과거형으로 바꾸세요.<br>Wir sind nach Gangneung gefahren und haben dort Freunde getroffen.<br>→ Wir <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> nach Gangneung und <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"> dort Freunde.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리는 강릉에 가서 거기서 친구들을 만났어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · 현재완료를 과거형으로 바꾸세요.<br>Wir sind nach Gangneung gefahren und haben dort Freunde getroffen.<br>→ Wir <b>fuhren</b> nach Gangneung und <b>trafen</b> dort Freunde.</div>과거형은 보조 동사 없이 동사 하나로 말해요.<br>fahren → fuhr, treffen → traf, wir에는 -en을 붙여요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"292e37d4c7\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Ich habe meine Tante nicht abholen können&quot;,&quot;Meine Tante habe ich nicht abholen können&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">30.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">나는 이모를 데리러 가지 못했어요. (현재완료로)</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">meine</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">nicht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">können</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Tante</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">abholen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">habe</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">Ich</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Ich habe meine Tante nicht abholen können.</b></div>화법조동사의 현재완료 — habe … abholen können.<br>nicht는 끝의 원형 두 개 앞에 와요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge plus-badge\">보강</span><span class=\"sub-title\">보강 문제 · 문장을 바꿔 쓰고, 